    "Larry has:\n\n- \\(3\\) cats\n- \\(3 \\times 3 = 9\\) dogs\n- \\(9-2=7\\) rabbits\n- \\(F\\) fish\n- \\(\\frac{F}{3}\\) gerbils\n\nThe total number of pets is\n\n\\[\n3+9+7+F+\\frac{F}{3}\n=19+\\frac{4F}{3}.\n\\]\n\nAt \\$6 per package, the total cost is\n\n\\[\n6\\left(19+\\frac{4F}{3}\\right)=114+8F.\n\\]\n\nBecause the number of fish is still unknown, the exact amount cannot be determined.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{The total cost cannot be determined from the information given.}}\n\\]",
